APET2025_T0388.pdf

# PI's paper folder (copyrighted PDFs + local data/results dumps)
ATLI/
*.zip

# Hard-negative review image dumps (regenerate via analysis/hard_negatives/)
analysis/hard_negatives/review/
analysis/hard_negatives/review_annotated/

