results/classvet_review/review/
results/classvet_review/pairs/
results/box_compare/

# Unrelated side project (relocate out of this repo when convenient)
amazon-order-tracker/

# Personal communications — never commit
results/email_*.md
results/update_*.md

# Local tooling / OS cruft
.claude/
.DS_Store

# private drafts / redacted content — never commit
results/email_to_PI*.md
results/LOCAL_*
results/data_outreach*.md
*.pdf

# Dedupe backups + regenerable duplicate-review contact sheets (plan/findings
# committed in rebalance/eduardo_dedupe_plan.json + results/eduardo_dedup_audit.md;
